DRIFT @PROJECT_VERSION@ - made with AtomEngine
==============================================

Fly down an endless path at dusk. Thread the rings, collect the orbs,
dodge the rocks: every clean pass raises the flow, and the music -
synthesised live as you play - builds with it.

Start: double-click Drift.exe. Nothing to install.
Needs: Windows 10 or 11 (64-bit) and a Direct3D 12 GPU.

Controls
--------
  Click                  launch (on the title screen)
  WASD / Arrows / Mouse  steer
  Shift                  boost
  M                      mute
  Esc                    pause: resume, settings, quit

Settings and logs
-----------------
Settings (Esc > Settings: display, volume, graphics card) and the log of
each run are kept per user, not in this folder:

  %APPDATA%\AtomEngine\Drift\settings.json
  %APPDATA%\AtomEngine\Drift\logs\Drift.log            (this run)
  %APPDATA%\AtomEngine\Drift\logs\Drift.previous.log

If it doesn't start
-------------------
A message names the reason and the log. Useful to try, from a terminal
in this folder:

  Drift.exe --gpu low-power        the integrated GPU (laptops)
  Drift.exe --gpu high-performance the dedicated GPU
  Drift.exe --diagnostics report.txt
                                   writes what the game found (GPU,
                                   display) and quits

When reporting a problem, send Drift.log and that report.

